==Miscellaneous Changes==
*'''Japanese''' release now supports English whereas the launch of the '''Southeast Asia''' version has support for English, Korean, and Traditional Chinese.
*Continues now cost 3 [[Cat Food]] instead of 15 Cat Food.
*Adjusted pull rates for Uber Rare Cats in standard banners.
**Rares: 70% → 65%
**Uber Rares: 10% → 15%
*Increased rates in obtaining Rare Tickets in minigames.
**Adjusted pull rate of Normal Tickets from 50% → 40%.
**Adjusted pull rate of Rare Tickets from 10% → 20%.
*Increased energy bonus from 20% → 30% after clearing any minigame.
*Amount of [[treasure]] duplicates obtained has been increased from 3 → 30
**In the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version, the amount of treasure duplicates is unlimited.
*The game no longer has a punishment for changing the system's clock.
*The following units have had their names and descriptions removed from this update:
**[[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Flying Ninja Cat]], [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]], [[Samurai Cat (Special Cat)|Pastry Cat]], [[Zombie Cat (Special Cat)|Skelecat]], [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]], [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]], [[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]], [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]], [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]], [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Beefcake Cat]], [[Tricycle Cat (Special Cat)|Unicycle Cat]], [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Hyper Mr.]], [[Skirt Cat (Special Cat)|Loincloth Cat]], [[Panties Cat (Special Cat)|Lollycat]], and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]].
**This was to remove the placeholder tags from their names and descriptions, that being "@".

